# text.pdl - the words of the "next" line of the side panel (CONFIG). The panel is the same for every civ; the line says what to do next.
TEXT | next_pick | Next: press ] to pick your settler
TEXT | next_walk | Next: arrows walk the settler to open land
TEXT | next_found | Next: press B to found a city here
TEXT | next_endturn | Next: press Space to end the turn
TEXT | next_move | Next: move a unit, or Space to end the turn
TEXT | next_end | Next: press Space to end the turn
TEXT | setup_next | Up/Down pick, Left/Right change, Enter starts
